sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GattClient]
    participant Peripheral as BLE Peripheral

    Note over Node, Peripheral: Messages between Node and BLE Peripheral<br>are link-layer events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through<br>Echo callbacks (e.g. ReadCharacteristicResponse).
    Note over App, Node: Allowed states: connected.<br>Pre-conditions: valueHandle known from<br>CharacteristicDiscovered.<br>Response sequences:<br>- Success: ReadCharacteristicResponse(data)<br>  -> OperationComplete(success).<br>- Error: OperationComplete(error) on<br>  ATT / permissions failure.<br>- Retry: OperationComplete(retry) when the<br>  ATT bearer is momentarily busy.

    App->>Node: GattClient.ReadCharacteristic(0x0025)

    alt Successful read
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_READ_REQ (handle=0x0025)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_READ_RSP (value)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ReadCharacteristicResponse(<br>data={handle=0x0025, data=0x64})
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)
    else ATT error (e.g. read not permitted)
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_READ_REQ (handle=0x0025)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_ERROR_RSP (error code)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(error)
    end
